          "type": "markdown",
          "title": "What a paired device gets",
          "content": "The device gets a named, revocable key for **one** Ada HA instance:\n\n- **Voice PWA** \u2014 Gemini Live voice assistant\n- **Control** \u2014 lights, switches, fans, media players, buttons; covers/gates need spoken confirmation; rate-limited; audit-logged per device name\n- **Reads** \u2014 states, sensors + history, power summary, event timelines, dashboard tabs, device search\n- **Memory** \u2014 recall + remember/forget on the instance's memory banks\n\nNot granted: minting/revoking keys (admin only), HA credentials (server-side), the other instance. Revoking a key kills its sessions immediately.\n\n[Open full pair admin page](https://mn01.taila0626a.ts.net/apps/ha/pair/)"
        }
